# kpl-core

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Product memory in `specs/`; agent canon in `agents/`.

## Token protocol

1. One skill (`agents/skills/<name>/` or `.cursor/skills/<name>/` — same body)
2. `memory/INDEX.md` → max 1–2 cards
3. Only current `specs/features/<id>/` files needed
4. STANDARDS + pragmatic ladder — don't paste into chat
5. Product files ≥500 lines: Grep or Read with offset/limit; hook blocks → skill `bulk-read`

## Cycle

Discover → PRD → specs+tasks → designer brief → mockups → branch → implement → security → publish

## Branches

Never on `main`. Prefixes: `feature/` | `fix/` | `chore/`

## Architecture mentor

On design or non-trivial implement: **Pattern / Why here / Tradeoff / Not doing**. Prefer boring. Ladder before layers.

Load skill `architecture-mentor` when crossing modules, auth, data ownership, trust boundaries, or writing an ADR.

## Skills

Discover by description under `.cursor/skills/`. Index: `specs/SKILLS.md`. Full practices: `agents/rules/`.
